
# Lab 1: Phishing URL Detection

## Overview
This lab focuses on phishing URL detection using Machine Learning and the PhiUSIIL Phishing URL Dataset.

## Contents
- `M115_Lab1_Rapport.ipynb`: Lab report with answers and explanations.
- `notebook180e60961b.ipynb`: Notebook containing the code, outputs and analysis.

## Dataset
[PhiUSIIL Phishing URL Dataset](https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/kaggleprollc/phishing-url-websites-dataset-phiusiil)

## Kaggle Contribution
https://www.kaggle.com/code/soukainadraich/notebook180e60961b

## Technologies
- Python
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Matplotlib
- Seaborn
- Scikit-learn
- Machine Learning

## Objectives
- Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)
- Data preprocessing
- Feature analysis
- Machine Learning model training
- Model evaluation

